{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master tactical spellcraft in <strong><i>Pluto</i></strong>, a roguelike where you invoke elemental runes to cast spells. Channel elements and chain combos to conquer your foes. Will your magic be powerful enough to reach your niece\u2019s birthday?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect &amp; Cast</strong>\u00a0Acquire spells with elemental recipes and invoke runes to cast them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolving Spellbook</strong>\u00a0Discover new spells, upgrade old ones, and collect powerful artifacts that reshape your strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Distinct Playstyles\u00a0</strong>Unlock characters with unique  spells and elemental affinities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong>\u00a0Adapt to tactical enemy formations, colossal bosses, and shifting elemental draws. No two runs play alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Horror</strong> Experience a haunting dark fantasy world with art by DitchWitch</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3057670?t=1742342249","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057670/753f9c3ff7b7bd7f0f3b494613fdd1a7b9012044/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742342249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057670/f4050aaefa5d5c0d06eba2f726637d48f49a617a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742342249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057670/f4050aaefa5d5c0d06eba2f726637d48f49a617a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742342249","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descri